        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Tanner is back and full of rage in the new Driver Renegade for the Nintendo 3DS. Driver Renegade takes place between the stories of Driver 1 and Driver 2. After years of undercover work for the NYPD, John Tanner leaves his badge and takes protection under Senator Ballard to take care of crime in his own way. As a renegade, Tanner cleans up the New York streets and punishes those that oppose him. Driver Renegade brings non- stop 3D car chases to the Nintendo 3DS system.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Tanner regresa lleno de furia en Driver Renegade para Nintendo 3DS. Driver Renegade transcurre entre las historias de Driver 1 y Driver 2. Tras años de trabajo encubierto para la NYPD, John Tanner deja su placa y se pone bajo la protección del senador Ballard para combatir el crimen a su manera. Como renegado, Tanner limpia las calles de Nueva York y castiga a quienes se le oponen. Driver Renegade ofrece persecuciones de autos en 3D sin pausa en la consola Nintendo 3DS.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2011",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
