        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The player is John Tanner, an undercover cop who try to take advantage of his own excellent driving skill in order to infiltrate a criminal organization.\nIn the storyline, the player has the chance to drive several cars in four american cities (Miami, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and New York), facing many different missions and tasks such as delivering a vehicle without damaging it, eliminating competitors or being the getaway driver in a bank robbery.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El jugador es John Tanner, un policía encubierto que intenta aprovechar su excelente habilidad al volante para infiltrarse en una organización criminal.\nEn la historia, el jugador puede conducir varios autos en cuatro ciudades estadounidenses (Miami, San Francisco, Los Ángeles y Nueva York), enfrentando muchas misiones y tareas distintas, como entregar un vehículo sin dañarlo, eliminar competidores o ser el conductor de la fuga en un robo a un banco.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1999",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
